From: Androlinzberg <host@androlinzberg.local>
Subject: [PATCH] Image JNI: enable stock gralloc and plane operations on the host

Keep ImageReader, ImageWriter and SurfaceUtils Java sources and registration
unchanged. The installed media_jni library supports their stock initialization.
Enable actual gralloc usage, HardwareBuffer and image-plane operations; the
Layoutlib branches deliberately erase CPU usage and are unsuitable for GBM.
Remove an unused camera header from the native surface queries.

diff --git a/core/jni/android_hardware_camera2_utils_SurfaceUtils.cpp b/core/jni/android_hardware_camera2_utils_SurfaceUtils.cpp
--- a/core/jni/android_hardware_camera2_utils_SurfaceUtils.cpp
+++ b/core/jni/android_hardware_camera2_utils_SurfaceUtils.cpp
